  (114, 'grass-mail', 'all-mail', 'mail', 4, 0, NULL, NULL, 'Used to send short messages to other players via Pokémon trading. Trainer may compose a message from a finite list of words when giving this item to a Pokémon. Once taken and read, a message may be erased and this item can be reused, or the message may be stored in the trainer’s PC. Held : Holder cannot be placed in the PC. Any move attempting to remove this item from the holder will fail.', 'Lets a Trainer write a message and send it via Pokémon trade.', 'items/grass-mail.png', NULL, false, '{}'),
