  (128, 'pecha-berry', 'medicine', 'berries', 2, 0, 10, 'berry-effect', 'Held in battle : When the holder is poisoned, it consumes this item to cure the poison. Used on a party Pokémon : Cures poison.', 'Held: Consumed when poisoned to cure poison.', 'items/pecha-berry.png', 'pechaberry', true, ARRAY['3','4','5','6','7','8','9','nationaldex','legendsza']::text[]),
  (129, 'rawst-berry', 'medicine', 'berries', 2, 0, 10, 'berry-effect', 'Held in battle : When the holder is burned, it consumes this item to cure the burn. Used on a party Pokémon : Cures a burn.', 'Held: Consumed when burned to cure a burn.', 'items/rawst-berry.png', 'rawstberry', true, ARRAY['3','4','5','6','7','8','9','nationaldex','legendsza']::text[]),
  (130, 'aspear-berry', 'medicine', 'berries', 2, 0, 10, 'berry-effect', 'Held in battle : When the holder is frozen, it consumes this item to thaw itself. Used on a party Pokémon : Cures freezing.', 'Held: Consumed when frozen to cure frozen.', 'items/aspear-berry.png', 'aspearberry', true, ARRAY['3','4','5','6','7','8','9','nationaldex','legendsza']::text[]),
  (131, 'leppa-berry', 'medicine', 'berries', 2, 0, 10, 'berry-effect', 'Held in battle : When the holder is out of PP for one of its moves, it consumes this item to restore 10 of that move’s PP. Used on a party Pokémon : Restores 10 PP for a selected move.', 'Held: Consumed when a move runs out of PP to restore its PP by 10.', 'items/leppa-berry.png', 'leppaberry', true, ARRAY['3','4','5','6','7','8','9','nationaldex','legendsza']::text[]),
