  (136, 'figy-berry', 'picky-healing', 'berries', 3, 0, 10, 'berry-effect', 'Held in battle : When the holder has 1/2 its max HP remaining or less, it consumes this item to restore 1/8 its max HP. If the holder dislikes spicy flavors (i.e., has a nature that lowers Attack), it will also become confused.', 'Held: Consumed at 1/2 max HP to restore 1/8 max HP. Confuses Pokémon that dislike spicy flavor.', 'items/figy-berry.png', 'figyberry', true, ARRAY['3','4','5','6','7','8','9','nationaldex','legendsza']::text[]),
